1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:10,413
Video ya leo ni… Wewe ni mtu wa namna gani? "Kueleza sifa za mtu"

2
00:00:10,413 --> 00:00:23,015
Katika sehemu fulani ya video, utaulizwa kwa Kijapani. Ukishasikia, tafadhali uandike maoni. Sehemu ya 1: Sifa za Mwalimu Mpya

3
00:00:23,015 --> 00:00:27,894
Mwalimu mpya wa Kijapani ni mtu wa namna gani?

4
00:00:27,917 --> 00:00:31,450
Ni mwalimu mrefu sana.

5
00:00:31,473 --> 00:00:33,520
Je, ana nywele ndefu?

6
00:00:33,543 --> 00:00:37,239
Hapana, ana nywele fupi.

7
00:00:37,263 --> 00:00:41,196
Je, ni mwalimu wa kiume au wa kike?

8
00:00:41,219 --> 00:00:43,752
Ni mwalimu wa kiume.

9
00:00:43,775 --> 00:00:46,109
Je, ni mwalimu mchanga?

10
00:00:46,132 --> 00:00:49,665
Ndiyo, anaonekana kuwa mchanga sana.

11
00:00:49,688 --> 00:00:52,156
Je, anaweza kuwa na miwani?

12
00:00:52,180 --> 00:00:55,793
Ndiyo, ana miwani nyeusi.

13
00:00:55,816 --> 00:00:58,249
Je, macho yake ni makubwa?

14
00:00:58,272 --> 00:01:02,047
Macho yake si makubwa sana.

15
00:01:02,071 --> 00:01:04,804
Kwa kawaida huvaa nguo za aina gani?

16
00:01:04,827 --> 00:01:08,594
Huvava shati ya buluu daima.

17
00:01:08,617 --> 00:01:10,817
Je, ni mwalimu mzuri?

18
00:01:10,840 --> 00:01:14,530
Ndiyo, ni mzuri sana.

19
00:01:14,554 --> 00:01:16,921
Je, ni mwalimu mpole?

20
00:01:16,944 --> 00:01:20,618
Ana tabasamu daima na anaonekana kuwa mpole.

21
00:01:20,641 --> 00:01:22,975
Je, mwili wake ni mkubwa?

22
00:01:22,998 --> 00:01:27,094
Ni mrefu na kidogo mwembamba.

23
00:01:27,117 --> 00:01:29,450
Je, sauti yake ni kubwa?

24
00:01:29,473 --> 00:01:33,450
Ndiyo, anazungumza kwa sauti kubwa sana.

25
00:01:33,474 --> 00:01:36,076
Inaeleweka vizuri.

26
00:01:36,100 --> 00:01:40,267
Saa ya mwalimu ni kubwa sana.

27
00:01:40,290 --> 00:01:42,168
Saa ni ya namna gani?

28
00:01:42,191 --> 00:01:45,630
Saa nyekundu na ya mviringo.

29
00:01:45,653 --> 00:01:47,656
Inaonekana ya kuvutia.

30
00:01:47,680 --> 00:01:51,446
Kesho nitamwonyesha katika darasa.

31
00:01:51,469 --> 00:01:54,324
Ndiyo, ninafurahi kusubiri.

32
00:01:54,348 --> 00:01:58,282
Aa, yule ndiye mwalimu mpya.

33
00:01:58,304 --> 00:02:02,104
Waa, kweli ni mrefu sana!

34
00:02:02,127 --> 00:02:05,604
Tazama, ana shati ya buluu.

35
00:02:05,628 --> 00:02:08,095
Nimegundua mara moja.

36
00:02:08,118 --> 00:02:15,223
Kiungo cha tovuti ambapo unaweza kukagua video ya leo kipo kwenye maelezo na maoni ya juu. *Tovuti inaweza kuondolewa bila tahadhari.

37
00:02:15,223 --> 00:02:18,223
Sehemu ya 2: Kueleza Sifa za Mtu

38
00:02:18,223 --> 00:02:22,122
Tanaka yuko wapi?

39
00:02:22,146 --> 00:02:26,579
Sasa yuko mbele ya kituo cha treni.

40
00:02:26,602 --> 00:02:31,602
Mbele ya kituo kuna watu wengi, sivyo?

41
00:02:31,625 --> 00:02:36,694
Tanaka amevaa nguo za aina gani?

42
00:02:36,717 --> 00:02:40,287
Amevaa jaketi nyeupe.

43
00:02:40,310 --> 00:02:43,912
Suruali ni ya rangi gani?

44
00:02:43,936 --> 00:02:47,469
Amevaa suruali nyeusi.

45
00:02:47,492 --> 00:02:50,531
Je, ana kofia?

46
00:02:50,555 --> 00:02:55,452
Ndiyo, ana kofia ya rangi ya kahawia.

47
00:02:55,475 --> 00:02:58,642
Je, nywele zake ni ndefu au fupi?

48
00:02:58,665 --> 00:03:00,701
Fupi?

49
00:03:00,725 --> 00:03:04,758
Nywele zake ni ndefu kidogo.

50
00:03:04,781 --> 00:03:07,655
Je, ana mfuko?

51
00:03:07,679 --> 00:03:12,372
Nina mfuko mkubwa wa rangi ya manjano.

52
00:03:12,395 --> 00:03:16,329
Mfuko wa manjano unavutia macho, kweli?

53
00:03:16,352 --> 00:03:20,552
Je, Bwana Tanaka ni mrefu?

54
00:03:20,575 --> 00:03:24,650
Hapana, si mrefu sana.

55
00:03:24,673 --> 00:03:28,330
Je, anaweza kuwa hana miwani?

56
00:03:28,354 --> 00:03:31,120
Hana miwani.

57
00:03:31,143 --> 00:03:35,777
Kuna mtu pale aliyevaa kofia ya rangi ya kahawia.

58
00:03:35,800 --> 00:03:39,875
Je, yule mtu ana jeki nyeupe?

59
00:03:39,898 --> 00:03:44,232
Ndio, amevaa jeki nyeupe.

60
00:03:44,255 --> 00:03:47,539
Je, ana mfuko wa manjano?

61
00:03:47,562 --> 00:03:52,005
Aa, ana mfuko mdogo mweusi.

62
00:03:52,028 --> 00:03:56,716
Basi, yule siyo Bwana Tanaka.

63
00:03:56,740 --> 00:04:01,012
Je, viatu vya Bwana Tanaka ni rangi gani?

64
00:04:01,036 --> 00:04:04,677
Amevaa viatu vyeupe vyekundu.

65
00:04:04,701 --> 00:04:09,472
Aa, kuna mtu pale amevaa viatu vyeupe vyekundu.

66
00:04:09,495 --> 00:04:12,551
Je, ana kofia?

67
00:04:12,575 --> 00:04:15,941
Ndio, kofia ya kahawia.

68
00:04:15,964 --> 00:04:18,580
Je, mfuko ni wa rangi ya manjano?

69
00:04:18,604 --> 00:04:22,900
Ndio, ni mfuko mkubwa wa manjano.

70
00:04:22,923 --> 00:04:26,257
Yule ndiye Bwana Tanaka.

71
00:04:26,280 --> 00:04:35,359
Kama umeelewa, tafadhali uandike maoni.

72
00:04:35,359 --> 00:04:38,359
Sehemu ya 3: Picha za Familia / Kuonyesha Picha za Familia Yangu

73
00:04:38,359 --> 00:04:41,959
Je, hii ni picha ya familia?

74
00:04:41,982 --> 00:04:43,182
Ndio.

75
00:04:43,205 --> 00:04:46,459
Hii ni picha tuliyoipiga mwaka jana wakati wa kiangazi.

76
00:04:46,482 --> 00:04:51,732
Je, huyu mtu mrefu ni kaka yako?

77
00:04:51,756 --> 00:04:56,156
Hapana, huyu ni mdogo wangu.

78
00:04:56,179 --> 00:05:00,379
Mdogo wako ni mrefu sana!

79
00:05:00,402 --> 00:05:02,002
Ndio.

80
00:05:02,025 --> 00:05:05,203
Ana urefu wa sentimita 180.

81
00:05:05,226 --> 00:05:09,959
Ana nywele fupi na anaonekana mchezaji mzuri wa michezo.

82
00:05:09,982 --> 00:05:11,198
Ndio.

83
00:05:11,222 --> 00:05:14,280
Anacheza mpira kila siku.

84
00:05:14,304 --> 00:05:19,637
Je, huyu binti mrembo ni dada yako?

85
00:05:19,660 --> 00:05:21,027
Ndio.

86
00:05:21,050 --> 00:05:23,653
Huyu ni dada yangu.

87
00:05:23,676 --> 00:05:28,882
Ana nywele ndefu, macho makubwa na anaonekana mrembo sana!

88
00:05:28,906 --> 00:05:32,202
Dada yangu anafanana sana na mama.

89
00:05:32,226 --> 00:05:34,921
Mama yako yuko wapi?

90
00:05:34,945 --> 00:05:37,878
Yuko karibu na dada yangu.

91
00:05:37,901 --> 00:05:40,999
Je, mama yako pia ana nywele ndefu?

92
00:05:41,022 --> 00:05:45,224
Hapana, mama ana nywele fupi.

93
00:05:45,247 --> 00:05:47,664
Amevaa kimono, sawa?

94
00:05:47,688 --> 00:05:49,055
Ndio.

95
00:05:49,078 --> 00:05:51,354
Alivaa wakati wa mwaka mpya.

96
00:05:51,377 --> 00:05:54,744
Baba yako yuko wapi?

97
00:05:54,767 --> 00:05:58,700
Yuko nyuma, mtu aliyevaa miwani.

98
00:05:58,723 --> 00:06:03,090
Baba anaonekana mtu mpole.

99
00:06:03,113 --> 00:06:04,579
Ndio.

100
00:06:04,602 --> 00:06:07,697
Ni mtu mwenye bidii na mpole sana.

101
00:06:07,721 --> 00:06:10,688
Je, baba yako ana unene?

102
00:06:10,711 --> 00:06:14,311
Hapana, ana mwili mwembamba kidogo.

103
00:06:14,334 --> 00:06:18,367
Unafanana na baba yako, kweli?

104
00:06:18,390 --> 00:06:20,390
Watu husema mara kwa mara.

105
00:06:20,413 --> 00:06:24,213
Hasa umbo la pua linafanana kabisa.

106
00:06:24,236 --> 00:06:28,106
Kweli? Naona kidogo aibu.

107
00:06:28,130 --> 00:06:32,130
Familia yenye furaha na shughuli nyingi, sivyo?

108
00:06:32,153 --> 00:06:33,519
Ndio.

109
00:06:33,542 --> 00:06:36,281
Kila mmoja anazungumza sana.

110
00:06:36,305 --> 00:06:38,592
Picha nzuri sana hii!

111
00:06:38,615 --> 00:06:40,906
Asante.

112
00:06:40,930 --> 00:06:43,930
Sehemu ya 4: Sifa za Mtu Kwenye Meza ya Karibu / Kuelezea Mtu Kwenye Meza Jirani

113
00:06:43,930 --> 00:06:47,930
Tazama kwenye meza iliyoko karibu.

114
00:06:47,953 --> 00:06:49,807
Mtu gani?

115
00:06:49,831 --> 00:06:54,317
Yule anayesoma kitabu peke yake.

116
00:06:54,341 --> 00:06:59,151
Je, ni yule mzee mwenye nywele nyeupe na fupi?

117
00:06:59,174 --> 00:07:04,174
Hapana, ni yule msichana kijana aliye karibu naye.

118
00:07:04,197 --> 00:07:08,079
Aa, yule mrembo!

119
00:07:08,103 --> 00:07:12,036
Nywele zake ni ndefu na nyororo.

120
00:07:12,059 --> 00:07:16,126
Inasemekana macho yake yana rangi ya buluu kidogo.

121
00:07:16,150 --> 00:07:18,559
Je, ni mgeni?

122
00:07:18,582 --> 00:07:22,116
Eeh, sijui.

123
00:07:22,139 --> 00:07:25,105
Anavaa gauni jeupe.

124
00:07:25,128 --> 00:07:29,062
Inamkamilisha sana, ni nzuri mno!

125
00:07:29,085 --> 00:07:31,418
Je, ana urefu?

126
00:07:31,441 --> 00:07:33,095
Je, ana ufupi?

127
00:07:33,118 --> 00:07:38,094
Kwa sababu yuko ameketi, sijui, lakini anaonekana mrefu.

128
00:07:38,118 --> 00:07:41,485
Mikono yake ni myembamba na safi sana.

129
00:07:41,509 --> 00:07:44,594
Vidole vyake ni virefu.

130
00:07:44,617 --> 00:07:47,354
Anakunywa nini?

131
00:07:47,377 --> 00:07:50,623
Anakunywa chai moto.

132
00:07:50,647 --> 00:07:53,516
Mfuko wake ni wa aina gani?

133
00:07:53,540 --> 00:07:58,173
Chini ya meza kuna mfuko wa ngozi nyeusi.

134
00:07:58,196 --> 00:08:01,470
Je, ana saa?

135
00:08:01,493 --> 00:08:06,227
Ndiyo, ana saa ndogo ya fedha.

136
00:08:06,250 --> 00:08:09,744
Anasoma kitabu kwa utulivu sana.

137
00:08:09,767 --> 00:08:13,134
Je, anasoma kitabu cha aina gani?

138
00:08:13,157 --> 00:08:16,845
Inaonekana ni kitabu chenye kanji ngumu.

139
00:08:16,868 --> 00:08:19,735
Anaonekana mwerevu sana.

140
00:08:19,758 --> 00:08:23,524
Aa! Hivi sasa alitazama saa.

141
00:08:23,547 --> 00:08:26,992
Labda anangojea mtu fulani.

142
00:08:27,016 --> 00:08:30,291
Tabasamu yake ni nzuri mno!

143
00:08:30,315 --> 00:08:33,971
Mtu mwenye mvuto sana!

144
00:08:33,995 --> 00:08:36,995
Sehemu ya 5: Sifa za Bwana Yamada / Sifa za Bwana Yamada

145
00:08:36,995 --> 00:08:41,974
Je, unafahamu mfanyakazi mpya, Bwana Yamada?

146
00:08:41,997 --> 00:08:44,531
Bado sijamwona.

147
00:08:44,554 --> 00:08:46,487
Yeye ni mtu wa aina gani?

148
00:08:46,510 --> 00:08:51,477
Ni mtu mwenye nguvu na mchangamfu.

149
00:08:51,499 --> 00:08:54,366
Je, ana urefu?

150
00:08:54,389 --> 00:08:58,522
Hapana, si mrefu sana.

151
00:08:58,545 --> 00:09:01,512
Je, mwili wake ni mkubwa?

152
00:09:01,535 --> 00:09:06,668
Ana unene kidogo, lakini ana misuli.

153
00:09:06,691 --> 00:09:09,691
Je, nywele zake zina umbo gani?

154
00:09:09,714 --> 00:09:14,563
Nywele zake ni fupi na nyeusi.

155
00:09:14,587 --> 00:09:17,638
Je, ana miwani?

156
00:09:17,661 --> 00:09:22,400
Ndiyo, ana miwani ya mviringo.

157
00:09:22,424 --> 00:09:25,958
Je, uso wake una sifa za pekee?

158
00:09:25,980 --> 00:09:29,870
Nyusi zake ni nzito sana.

159
00:09:29,894 --> 00:09:33,028
Unahusu nywele nyingi kwenye nyusi, eh?

160
00:09:33,051 --> 00:09:35,852
Ni rahisi kukumbuka.

161
00:09:35,875 --> 00:09:40,494
Pia, masikio yako ni kidogo makubwa.

162
00:09:40,517 --> 00:09:43,331
Sauti yako ni ya namna gani?

163
00:09:43,355 --> 00:09:48,688
Sauti yako ni nzito na nzuri sana.

164
00:09:48,711 --> 00:09:52,346
Kila wakati huvaa suti ya aina gani?

165
00:09:52,370 --> 00:09:56,503
Mara nyingi huvaa suti ya kijivu.

166
00:09:56,526 --> 00:09:59,462
Necktie yako ni rangi gani?

167
00:09:59,485 --> 00:10:03,685
Leo nina necktie nyekundu.

168
00:10:03,708 --> 00:10:06,375
Viatu vyako vinaonekana safi?

169
00:10:06,399 --> 00:10:11,244
Ndio, viatu vya ngozi nyeusi vinawaka daima.

170
00:10:11,267 --> 00:10:14,201
Unaonekana kuwa mtu mwenye utaratibu.

171
00:10:14,225 --> 00:10:19,258
Ndio, unaonekana kufanya kazi haraka sana.

172
00:10:19,281 --> 00:10:21,931
Una umri gani hivi?

173
00:10:21,954 --> 00:10:25,188
Ninafikiri ana umri wa miaka 30 hivi.

174
00:10:25,211 --> 00:10:28,705
Anaonekana kijana na mtu anayeweza kutegemewa.

175
00:10:28,729 --> 00:10:32,895
Aa, yule mtu anayefanya kopi huko.

176
00:10:32,918 --> 00:10:36,328
Yule mtu mwenye miwani mviringo, ndiyo?

177
00:10:36,352 --> 00:10:40,352
Ndio, yule ndiye Bwana Yamada.

178
00:10:40,375 --> 00:10:44,231
Nitamwendea baadaye ili nimsubiri.

179
00:10:44,254 --> 00:10:47,254
Mstari wa 6: Kutambua Sifa za Mtoto Aliopotea

180
00:10:47,254 --> 00:10:48,864
Samahani.

181
00:10:48,887 --> 00:10:51,521
Tunatafuta mtoto aliyepotea.

182
00:10:51,543 --> 00:10:54,013
Mtoto yupi?

183
00:10:54,037 --> 00:10:57,439
Ni mvulana wa miaka mitano.

184
00:10:57,463 --> 00:11:00,111
Jina lake ni nani?

185
00:11:00,134 --> 00:11:02,409
Jina lake ni Takeshi.

186
00:11:02,433 --> 00:11:06,501
Takeshi ana urefu wa kiasi gani?

187
00:11:06,524 --> 00:11:10,258
Ana urefu wa sentimita 100 hivi.

188
00:11:10,281 --> 00:11:13,579
Nywele zake zina umbo gani?

189
00:11:13,602 --> 00:11:18,891
Ana nywele fupi na rangi ya kahawia kidogo.

190
00:11:18,914 --> 00:11:21,881
Je, ana macho makubwa?

191
00:11:21,904 --> 00:11:26,737
Ndio, ana macho makubwa na mviringo.

192
00:11:26,760 --> 00:11:30,843
Leo amevaa nguo gani?

193
00:11:30,867 --> 00:11:34,334
Amevaa tisheti ya manjano.

194
00:11:34,357 --> 00:11:38,629
Je, kuna picha yoyote kwenye tisheti?

195
00:11:38,653 --> 00:11:43,187
Ndio, mbele kuna picha kubwa ya dubu.

196
00:11:43,210 --> 00:11:46,386
Amevaa suruali ya rangi gani?

197
00:11:46,409 --> 00:11:50,142
Amevaa kaptura ya buluu.

198
00:11:50,165 --> 00:11:53,498
Amevaa viatu gani?

199
00:11:53,521 --> 00:11:56,993
Amevaa viatu vya michezo vyeupe.

200
00:11:57,017 --> 00:12:01,450
Alikuwa amevaa kofia?

201
00:12:01,473 --> 00:12:05,754
Ndio, alikuwa amevaa kofia ya kijani.

202
00:12:05,778 --> 00:12:08,544
Ana mfuko?

203
00:12:08,567 --> 00:12:12,601
Ndio, ana mfuko mdogo mwekundu mwenye mikanda.

204
00:12:12,624 --> 00:12:16,319
Kuna sifa yoyote maalum?

205
00:12:16,342 --> 00:12:20,876
Kuna doa dogo upande wa kulia.

206
00:12:20,899 --> 00:12:22,932
Nimeelewa.

207
00:12:22,955 --> 00:12:25,014
Tutamtafuta.

208
00:12:25,038 --> 00:12:27,411
Ninahangaika sana.

209
00:12:27,434 --> 00:12:29,567
Tafadhali nisaidie.

210
00:12:29,590 --> 00:12:32,190
Ulikuwa unalia?

211
00:12:32,213 --> 00:12:34,251
Ulikuwa unacheka?

212
00:12:34,275 --> 00:12:37,008
Alikuwa akiruka kwa nguvu.

213
00:12:37,031 --> 00:12:39,669
Inaonekana atapatikana hivi punde.

214
00:12:39,692 --> 00:12:41,492
Usijali.

215
00:12:41,515 --> 00:12:46,809
Aa, naona tisheti ya njano huko.

216
00:12:46,833 --> 00:12:50,100
Je, ana mfuko mwekundu mgongoni?

217
00:12:50,123 --> 00:12:53,527
Ndiyo, ana mfuko mgongoni.

218
00:12:53,551 --> 00:12:55,084
Huyu ni Takeshi.

219
00:12:55,107 --> 00:12:57,274
Sawa sana, hiyo ni nzuri.

220
00:12:57,297 --> 00:12:59,535
Jihadhari.

221
00:12:59,558 --> 00:13:02,558
Sehemu ya 7: Sifa za Mwimbaji Ninayempenda / Characteristics of My Favorite Singer

222
00:13:02,558 --> 00:13:07,725
Ni mwimbaji upi unaompenda zaidi?

223
00:13:07,748 --> 00:13:13,314
Mwimbaji ninayempenda zaidi ni Ren wa Japani.

224
00:13:13,337 --> 00:13:16,539
Ren ni mtu wa aina gani?

225
00:13:16,563 --> 00:13:20,896
Yeye ni mtu mwenye sura nzuri sana.

226
00:13:20,919 --> 00:13:23,213
Je, ana urefu mkubwa?

227
00:13:23,237 --> 00:13:28,890
Ndiyo, ana urefu mkubwa sana na miguu mirefu.

228
00:13:28,914 --> 00:13:31,914
Uso wake unaonekana vipi?

229
00:13:31,937 --> 00:13:36,937
Uso wake ni mdogo sana na pua yake ni ndefu.

230
00:13:36,960 --> 00:13:41,127
Je, aina ya nywele zake huwa sawa daima?

231
00:13:41,150 --> 00:13:46,920
Hapana, mara kwa mara hubadilika, lakini sasa ni ndefu.

232
00:13:46,944 --> 00:13:49,983
Nywele zake ni za rangi gani?

233
00:13:50,006 --> 00:13:54,539
Sasa ana nywele za rangi ya fedha zinazong'ara.

234
00:13:54,562 --> 00:13:58,135
Nywele za rangi ya fedha ni nadra sana.

235
00:13:58,159 --> 00:14:02,792
Ndiyo, anang'ara sana jukwaani.

236
00:14:02,815 --> 00:14:05,790
Jicho lake linaonekana vipi?

237
00:14:05,814 --> 00:14:10,684
Ana macho madogo na yanayonekana baridi.

238
00:14:10,707 --> 00:14:14,483
Je, mwili wake ni mwembamba?

239
00:14:14,507 --> 00:14:18,873
Ndiyo, ana mwili mwembamba sana lakini ana nguvu.

240
00:14:18,896 --> 00:14:22,030
Aina gani ya nguo huvaa mara kwa mara?

241
00:14:22,053 --> 00:14:25,942
Huvva koti nyeusi ndefu mara kwa mara.

242
00:14:25,965 --> 00:14:28,365
Inaonekana kuwa ya kupendeza.

243
00:14:28,388 --> 00:14:31,265
Je, ana pete?

244
00:14:31,288 --> 00:14:36,138
Ndiyo, ana pete tatu kwenye sikio la kushoto.

245
00:14:36,162 --> 00:14:38,397
Je, mikono yake ni mikubwa?

246
00:14:38,420 --> 00:14:43,220
Mikono yake ni mikubwa na vidole vyake ni vyembamba sana.

247
00:14:43,243 --> 00:14:45,976
Sauti yako ni ya namna gani?

248
00:14:45,999 --> 00:14:50,566
Ana sauti tamu na kidogo ya chini.

249
00:14:50,589 --> 00:14:52,805
Ninapenda kusikia.

250
00:14:52,828 --> 00:14:56,461
Nitakupa CD wakati mwingine.

251
00:14:56,484 --> 00:14:58,166
Asante.

252
00:14:58,190 --> 00:15:00,123
Ninafurahi kusubiri.

253
00:15:00,146 --> 00:15:03,146
Sehemu ya 8: Mchumba wa Suzuki / Introducing Suzuki-san's Boyfriend

254
00:15:03,146 --> 00:15:08,479
Jana nilikutana na mchumba mpya wa Suzuki.

255
00:15:08,502 --> 00:15:10,912
Kweli?

256
00:15:10,936 --> 00:15:13,369
Alikuwa mtu wa aina gani?

257
00:15:13,392 --> 00:15:17,592
Alikuwa mtu mwenye huruma sana.

258
00:15:17,615 --> 00:15:20,182
Je, ana urefu?

259
00:15:20,205 --> 00:15:21,772
Je, ana ufupi?

260
00:15:21,796 --> 00:15:25,429
Ana urefu zaidi kidogo kuliko Suzuki.

261
00:15:25,452 --> 00:15:28,269
Ana nywele za aina gani?

262
00:15:28,292 --> 00:15:32,626
Ana nywele fupi na ana mwonekano safi sana.

263
00:15:32,649 --> 00:15:35,491
Je, alikuwa amevaa miwani?

264
00:15:35,515 --> 00:15:38,681
Hapana, hakukuwa amevaa.

265
00:15:38,704 --> 00:15:41,238
Je, ana uzito?

266
00:15:41,261 --> 00:15:43,297
Je, ana mwili mwembamba?

267
00:15:43,321 --> 00:15:47,721
Ana mwili wa kawaida, lakini mabega yake ni mapana.

268
00:15:47,744 --> 00:15:50,877
Je, anafanya michezo yoyote?

269
00:15:50,900 --> 00:15:54,714
Kutoka zamani, alikuwa anaswimu.

270
00:15:54,737 --> 00:15:57,871
Hivyo ndiyo maana mabega yake ni mapana.

271
00:15:57,894 --> 00:16:01,373
Uso wake una sifa gani za pekee?

272
00:16:01,396 --> 00:16:04,996
Machoni ni la upole na yanaanguka chini kidogo.

273
00:16:05,019 --> 00:16:08,219
Watu wenye macho yanayong'oka huonekana wapole, kweli?

274
00:16:08,242 --> 00:16:12,275
Ndiyo, alikuwa akicheka daima.

275
00:16:12,298 --> 00:16:15,197
Alivaa nguo za aina gani?

276
00:16:15,220 --> 00:16:18,754
Alikuwa amevaa shati ya mraba ya buluu.

277
00:16:18,777 --> 00:16:21,043
Suruali yake ni jeans?

278
00:16:21,066 --> 00:16:25,066
Ndiyo, alikuwa amevaa jeans safi.

279
00:16:25,089 --> 00:16:27,656
Je, alikuwa amevaa saa?

280
00:16:27,679 --> 00:16:31,012
Alikuwa amevaa saa ya michezo nyeusi.

281
00:16:31,035 --> 00:16:33,721
Je, alionekana kijana?

282
00:16:33,744 --> 00:16:37,111
Alionekana kama yule Suzuki.

283
00:16:37,134 --> 00:16:39,612
Wawili hawa wanalingana sana!

284
00:16:39,636 --> 00:16:43,515
Ndiyo, walionekana wenye furaha sana.

285
00:16:43,538 --> 00:16:46,831
Ninapenda nimwone hivi karibuni.

286
00:16:46,855 --> 00:16:50,455
Siku hizi tutakula pamoja.

287
00:16:50,478 --> 00:16:53,478
Sehemu ya 9: Kutafuta Mtu kwa Sifa Zake

288
00:16:53,478 --> 00:16:58,127
Kwenye ukumbi wa chama kuna watu wengi!

289
00:16:58,150 --> 00:17:01,585
Sato-san yuko wapi?

290
00:17:01,608 --> 00:17:04,847
Tafadhali niambie sifa za Sato-san.

291
00:17:04,870 --> 00:17:10,437
Sato-san ana nywele fupi na uso mdogo mwenye mviringo.

292
00:17:10,460 --> 00:17:12,693
Je, ana urefu?

293
00:17:12,716 --> 00:17:16,396
Hapana, hana urefu mkubwa.

294
00:17:16,420 --> 00:17:19,453
Leo amevaa nguo za aina gani?

295
00:17:19,476 --> 00:17:22,709
Amevaa gauni nyekundu.

296
00:17:22,732 --> 00:17:26,666
Kuna watu watatu waliovaa gauni nyekundu.

297
00:17:26,689 --> 00:17:29,866
Je, ana vito vya ziada?

298
00:17:29,890 --> 00:17:34,056
Alisema kuwa amevaa shanga za lulu.

299
00:17:34,079 --> 00:17:37,012
Yule mtu katikati?

300
00:17:37,035 --> 00:17:40,525
Yule ana nywele ndefu.

301
00:17:40,549 --> 00:17:43,045
Aa, kweli.

302
00:17:43,068 --> 00:17:45,635
Hana nywele fupi.

303
00:17:45,658 --> 00:17:48,791
Yule kwenye upande wa kulia?

304
00:17:48,814 --> 00:17:52,581
Yule amevaa miwani nyeusi.

305
00:17:52,604 --> 00:17:55,770
Je, Sato-san huvaa miwani?

306
00:17:55,793 --> 00:17:59,527
Hapana, Sato-san havai miwani.

307
00:17:59,550 --> 00:18:03,188
Basi, yule kwenye upande wa kushoto.

308
00:18:03,211 --> 00:18:06,744
Ana nywele fupi na uso mdogo mwenye mviringo?

309
00:18:06,767 --> 00:18:10,849
Ndiyo, uso mdogo mzuri mwenye mviringo.

310
00:18:10,873 --> 00:18:13,276
Shanga zake ni za lulu?

311
00:18:13,300 --> 00:18:17,139
Ndiyo, shanga nyeupe za lulu.

312
00:18:17,162 --> 00:18:20,041
Amevaa gauni nyekundu pia, sivyo?

313
00:18:20,064 --> 00:18:23,598
Ndiyo, gauni nyekundu nzuri.

314
00:18:23,621 --> 00:18:26,716
Unaiva viatu vya rangi gani?

315
00:18:26,739 --> 00:18:29,939
Ninaiva viatu vyeusi vya kizungu.

316
00:18:29,962 --> 00:18:32,047
Hakuna shaka.

317
00:18:32,070 --> 00:18:34,504
Yule ndiye Sato.

318
00:18:34,528 --> 00:18:37,016
Hatimae tumemkuta!

319
00:18:37,040 --> 00:18:40,007
Twende kumsalimia pamoja.

320
00:18:40,030 --> 00:18:43,030
Mstari wa 10: Kumkuta Mrembo Shibuya / Kuona Mtu Mrembo Shibuya

321
00:18:43,030 --> 00:18:48,286
Jana, niliuona mtu mzuri sana huko Shibuya.

322
00:18:48,309 --> 00:18:50,351
Ni mwanaume?

323
00:18:50,374 --> 00:18:52,508
Ni mwanamke?

324
00:18:52,531 --> 00:18:56,107
Ni mwanaume mrefu.

325
00:18:56,130 --> 00:18:59,304
Ulikuwa na urefu gani?

326
00:18:59,328 --> 00:19:03,863
Alikuwa na urefu wa sentimita mia moja themanini na tano hivi.

327
00:19:03,887 --> 00:19:06,687
Anafanana na mwanamitindo.

328
00:19:06,710 --> 00:19:11,076
Ndiyo, alikuwa na staili nzuri sana.

329
00:19:11,099 --> 00:19:14,133
Alikuwa na nywele za rangi gani?

330
00:19:14,156 --> 00:19:18,389
Alikuwa na nywele za rangi ya kahawia iliyofifia, na zilikuwa na perm.

331
00:19:18,412 --> 00:19:21,345
Ni mtindo wa nywele unaoshika!

332
00:19:21,368 --> 00:19:24,413
Ulikuwa na uso wa namna gani?

333
00:19:24,437 --> 00:19:29,124
Alikuwa na macho makali na makubwa.

334
00:19:29,147 --> 00:19:31,845
Je, alikuwa na ngozi nyeupe?

335
00:19:31,869 --> 00:19:36,487
Hapana, alikuwa na ngozi ya rangi ya ngano kidogo.

336
00:19:36,511 --> 00:19:39,345
Anaonekana kuwa na afya nzuri.

337
00:19:39,368 --> 00:19:42,802
Alikuwa amevaa nini?

338
00:19:42,825 --> 00:19:47,158
Alikuwa amevaa tisheti nyeusi kubwa.

339
00:19:47,181 --> 00:19:50,052
Alikuwa amevaa suruali gani?

340
00:19:50,075 --> 00:19:54,043
Alikuwa amevaa suruali nyeupe zenye upana.

341
00:19:54,067 --> 00:19:58,067
Alikuwa amevaa mkufu au pete?

342
00:19:58,090 --> 00:20:01,574
Alikuwa amevaa mkufu mrefu wa fedha.

343
00:20:01,597 --> 00:20:04,431
Alikuwa na mfuko?

344
00:20:04,454 --> 00:20:08,092
Alikuwa na mfuko mweusi mdogo wa mkono.

345
00:20:08,115 --> 00:20:10,948
Alikuwa na umri gani hivi?

346
00:20:10,971 --> 00:20:15,971
Alionekana kama ana umri wa miaka ishirini na mbili au ishirini na tatu.

347
00:20:15,994 --> 00:20:19,594
Labda alikuwa ni mwigizaji wa filamu.

348
00:20:19,617 --> 00:20:23,852
Kweli, watu wote walikuwa wanamwangalia.

349
00:20:23,876 --> 00:20:26,689
Ningependa kukutana naye tena.

350
00:20:26,712 --> 00:20:29,968
Leo nitakwenda Shibuya tena.